%description:

Tcp.delayedAcksEnabled:on -- with the delayed ACK, the receiver does not acknowledge a lone
segment at once.

The claim (Tcp.ned): "Delayed ACK algorithm (RFC 1122) enabled/disabled"; RFC 9293 section
3.8.6.3: a delayed ACK waits less than 0.5 s (MUST-40).

The classes: on (true, the default), off (false; LegacyTcp). The code: with the delayed ACK
and without adaptiveDelayedAcks, a segment that is not the second full-sized one starts the
delayed ACK timer (TcpAlgorithmBase::receiveSeqChanged()). This test separates "on" from
"off": with "off", the ACK goes at once.

Host under test: host2, the receiver. Peer: host1 sends one segment of 100 bytes.
Observation: level 1, the ACK that host2 sends: none in the first 100 ms after the segment
arrives, and one before 0.5 s.

%# parameter: Tcp.delayedAcksEnabled
%# class: on
%# value: true
%# key: *.host2.tcp.delayedAcksEnabled
%# expected-result: PASS

%includes:
#include "ProtocolTest.h"

%global:

using namespace inet;
using namespace inet::protocoltest;

Define_ProtocolTestProgram()
{
    return ProtocolTest("TcpDelayedAcksEnabledOn")
        .once(on("host2.tcp").signal("packetReceivedFromLower")
                  .filterPacket("tcp.synBit == false && pk.dataLength > tcp.headerLength")
                  .describe("the segment of 100 bytes at host2")
                  .within(0.5))
        .never(on("host2.tcp").signal("packetSentToLower")
                   .filterPacket("tcp.ackBit == true")
                   .describe("an ACK of host2 in the first 100 ms")
                   .within(0.1))
        .once(on("host2.tcp").signal("packetSentToLower")
                  .filterPacket("tcp.ackBit == true")
                  .describe("the delayed ACK of host2")
                  .within(0.4));
}

%activity:
EV << "TcpDelayedAcksEnabledOn compiled\n";

%inifile: omnetpp.ini

[General]
*.host2.tcp.delayedAcksEnabled = true    # the parameter under test
*.host1.app[0].sendBytes = 100B
include ../../parameter/ini/_bulk.ini
include ../../parameter/ini/_base.ini

%contains: stdout
PROTOCOLTEST TcpDelayedAcksEnabledOn: PASS
